Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?utf-8?q?waydroid-init=EF=BC=9A=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB=20?=
 =?utf-8?q?nvidia-prolapse=20vendor=20=E6=A8=A1=E5=9D=97=EF=BC=8CNVIDIA=20?=
 =?utf-8?q?=E4=B8=8B=E4=BD=BF=E7=94=A8=20minigbm=5Fgbm=5Fmesa=20=E4=B8=8E?=
 =?utf-8?q?=20vulkan.nvidia?=
